#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter08/packaging.xml:27
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The packaging module is a Python library that provides utilities that "
"implement the interoperability specifications which have clearly one correct"
" behaviour (PEP440) or benefit greatly from having a single shared "
"implementation (PEP425). This includes utilities for version handling, "
"specifiers, markers, tags, and requirements."
msgstr ""

